# roadmap Phase 6: dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/fire_rules.lua over whole games (PLAY=1, player 1 a
# person on team 1); fire_probe.lua counts the times somebody catches fire and the frames each
# team is on fire, logged at the end-of-game screen.
# - the game's rule: few fires (T.E. 1, SE 2);
# - 1 basket to catch fire: many (T.E. 9, SE 8); 8 baskets: none;
# - team 1 always on fire: team 1 on fire nearly the whole game, team 2 never;
# - team 2 never on fire: team 2 0 frames (holding the basket count at 0 for that team is what
#   does it: the game sets plyrnumonfire again from the count every frame);
# - team 1 never on fire with 1 basket: team 1 0 frames while team 2 still catches fire.
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/fire_rules.lua
extra fire_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse
frames 40001
env PLAY=1
run baskets=0 team1=0
run baskets=1 team2=0
run baskets=8
run team1=1
run team2=2
run team1=2 baskets=1
team1=0: nolog baskets to catch fire
nbajamte: team1=0: once fire total: 1 fires
nbajamse: team1=0: once fire total: 2 fires
team2=0: once baskets to catch fire: 1 (then 2)
nbajamte: team2=0: once fire total: 9 fires
nbajamse: team2=0: once fire total: 8 fires
baskets=8: once baskets to catch fire: 8 (then 9)
baskets=8: once fire total: 0 fires, team 1 0 frames, team 2 0 frames
team1=1: once team 1: always on fire
team1=1: once team 2 0 frames
team2=2: once team 2: never on fire
team2=2: once team 2 0 frames
team1=2: once team 1: never on fire
team1=2: once team 1 0 frames
